WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:06.520
An attendee at the elevators tells Whereabout where he is, and asks the way to booth 42.

00:08.600 --> 00:14.960
The app answers in plain words, one stretch at a time: how far to walk, what he'll pass, and where to turn.

00:17.500 --> 00:23.670
When a stretch is done, he says next, and hears the following one. He walks at his own pace, phone in hand.

00:26.000 --> 00:33.770
Every direction comes from the venue's floor plan, so it names what he'll actually pass: the hall entrance, the help desk, the booth.

00:37.900 --> 00:45.130
For the last few meters, he taps Guide me with the camera. The phone recognizes booth 42 and talks him up to it.

00:47.300 --> 00:50.800
He's there. Ask the way, and hear it, one stretch at a time.
